OL,3,GNEWSADrug smugglers jailed over #40m
OL,4,Acocaine plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve members of an organised crime
OL,7,Fgroup have been sentenced for their
OL,8,Frole in a plot which involved 500kg of
OL,9,Fcocaine, with an estimated value of
OL,10,F#40m, dropped at sea.
OL,12,FPolice caught the group bringing 16
OL,13,Fbales of cocaine ashore on the Sussex
OL,14,Fcoast after recovering the drugs from
OL,15,Fthe sea off the Isle of Wight in August
OL,16,F2024.
OL,18,FRingleaders Daniel Jamieson, 41, and
OL,19,FSam Brown, 33, were respectively
OL,20,Fsentenced to 22 years and 16 years and
OL,21,Fsix months at Portsmouth Crown Court
OL,22,Ffor conspiracy to smuggle cocaine.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
